  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">What is the area, in square centimeters, of a rectangle with a length of <math alttext=\"36\"><mn>36</mn>\n</math> centimeters and a width of <math alttext=\"34\"><mn>34</mn>\n</math> centimeters?</p>",
